      "content": "It sounds like you've developed a very painful logic around your existence, treating it like an unsolvable debt. That feeling of being a burden is powerful, but it's a distortion of reality that these services are trained to help you navigate. Please let someone who understands the nuances of this pain listen to you; they are equipped to help you see beyond this logical trap. You deserve support that sees *you*, not just the perceived problem.",
